#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The libm in 4.4BSD and some versions of FreeBSD had a B<gamma>()  function "
"that computes the Gamma function, as one would expect."
msgstr ""
"В libm из 4.4BSD и некоторых версиях FreeBSD имеется функция B<gamma>(), "
"которая вычисляет гамма-функцию, как и ожидается."

#. type: SS
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "glibc version"
msgstr "Версия glibc"

