msgid "SVID 2."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Because of historical variations in behavior across systems, this "
#| "function is not specified in any recent standard.  It was documented in "
#| "SVID 2."
msgid ""
"Because of historical variations in behavior across systems, this function "
"is not specified in any recent standard."
msgstr ""
"Из-за различий в поведении в различных системах эта функция не попала ни в "
"один современный стандарт. Она описана в SVID 2."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"4.2BSD had a B<gamma>()  that computed ln(|Gamma(|I<x>|)|), leaving the sign "
"of Gamma(|I<x>|)  in the external integer I<signgam>.  In 4.3BSD the name "
"was changed to B<lgamma>(3), and the man page promises"
msgstr ""
"В 4.2BSD функция B<gamma>() вычисляет ln(|Gamma(|I<x>|)|), записывая знак "
"Gamma(|I<x>|) во внешнее целое I<signgam>. В 4.3BSD было изменено имя на "
"B<lgamma>(3), и в справочной странице указано"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"At some time in the future the name gamma will be rehabilitated and used for "
"the Gamma function"
msgstr ""
"Через некоторое время имя gamma было восстановлено и использовано для гаммы-"
"функции"

#.  The FreeBSD man page says about gamma() that it is like lgamma()
#.  except that is does not set signgam.
#.  Also, that 4.4BSD has a gamma() that computes the true gamma function.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"This did indeed happen in 4.4BSD, where B<gamma>()  computes the Gamma "
"function (with no effect on I<signgam>).  However, this came too late, and "
"we now have B<tgamma>(3), the \"true gamma\" function."
msgstr ""
"В действительности это произошло в 4.4BSD, где B<gamma>() вычисляла гамма-"
"функцию (без влияния на I<signgam>). Однако, это случилось слишком поздно и "
"теперь мы имеем B<tgamma>(3), «настоящую» гамма-функцию."

